function renderHelp(){const tasks=[['How engineering requests a prototype',['Open Prototype Requests and choose New prototype request.','Complete the six guided steps: need, objective, date/priority, configuration, characterisation, review.','Submit only after the review confirms required data.','Track Requested Date, Current Forecast, Readiness, Risk, Owner and Next Action in the workspace.']],['How lab triages a request',['Open the request workspace.','Review objective, configuration, required date and requested characterisation.','First assess exact material supply/arrival and confirm the actual process + requested test methods. Only then run AUTO-PLAN to create visible equipment/person bookings and a forecast.','Commit the forecast and continue once the timing basis is acceptable; resolve Action Centre items instead of creating detached notes.']],['How to issue the correct build material',['Tap Material source & feasibility.','Review the required part number, revision and quantity for each BOM line.','For Lab supplied, reserve only exact matching part/revision lots; for Engineering supplied, record expected arrival and then receive the actual lot. Issue is required before build start.','Unmatched legacy allocations remain visible for audit history but do not satisfy readiness.']],['How to select a standard process',['In the guided checklist, tap Process route & test-method assessment.','Insert a released library process.','Use process fit assessment for capability/material/geometry fit.','If outside the released envelope, start modified/new process development.']],['How to develop a new process',['Open Process Library or tap Process route & test-method assessment in the guided checklist.','Create a development workflow: plan → trials → parameters → risk → measurement/capability → Control Plan → work instruction → approval → release.','Compare trials and retain observations/evidence.','Release only when required gates are satisfied.']],['How to create/review a Control Plan',['Open the guided checklist and tap Control Plan, risk controls & special approvals.','Link controls to process steps and characteristics.','Ensure every special characteristic has an objective target and/or limits, method/gauge, evidence and reaction plan.','Request independent review; approved plans are revised rather than silently edited.']],['How to perform build-readiness review',['In the guided checklist, tap Build readiness.','Review each large readiness line.','For a blocker, read what/why/who/action/evidence/then.','Use controlled override only with authorised role and recorded reason/risk.']],['How a technician executes a build',['Switch to Prototype Technician.','In the guided checklist, tap Serialise & execute digital traveller.','Follow the current digital-traveller step, select serial/equipment and enter required evidence.','Guard rails prevent invalid calibration, unreleased process use or missing mandatory evidence.']],['How to record characterisation',['In the guided checklist, tap Characterise, evaluate & disposition exceptions.','Use manual entry or CSV import.','Results retain raw values, units, limits, serial, method, equipment/calibration, operator and timestamp.','Out-of-limit results create/maintain a quality hold until disposed.']],['How to manage a deviation/rework',['In the guided checklist, tap Characterise, evaluate & disposition exceptions.','Contain, investigate and choose an authorised disposition.','For rework, route back to the controlled process and reinspection step.','Close only when mandatory actions and verification are complete.']],['How to sign off/release a build',['Follow the guided checklist through Characterise, evaluate & disposition exceptions and Release approval.','Confirm serial counts, configuration, deviations, characterisation and special-characteristic status.','Release only when required approvals and release-hold checks pass.','Then use Deliver, retain records & close.']],['How to find a serial-number history',['Use global search or Serial History.','Open the serial to see request, configuration, material lots, process revisions, measurements, deviations and delivery.']],['How to manage calibration, maintenance & training',['Open Equipment, Calibration, Maintenance & Training.','Review the optimized readiness plan; it uses committed bookings plus probability-weighted future demand to find the lowest-load slot before each due date.','Schedule a proposed slot so AUTO-PLAN treats it as unavailable capacity.','Record completed calibration with certificate number, issuer, traceability/reference and evidence. Training renewals remain certificate-gated.']],['How to generate a prototype report',['Open Reports globally or use Deliver, retain records & close for request records.','Generate the report. Drafts show AUTO-GENERATED · NOT APPROVED.','Use print/save-PDF from the browser for a portable copy.','Organisation-specific approval and retention remain configurable.']]];
 return pageHeader('Help / User Manual','Task-based guidance for the actual proof-of-concept application.')+`<div class="card"><h2>Quick Start</h2><div class="quick-start"><div class="quick-step"><strong>1 · Pick a role</strong><span>Use Demo role at the top right.</span></div><div class="quick-step"><strong>2 · Open a scenario</strong><span>Prototype Requests includes 15 seeded automotive examples.</span></div><div class="quick-step"><strong>3 · Follow Next Action</strong><span>Each workspace explains blockers and direct resolution paths.</span></div><div class="quick-step"><strong>4 · Test controls</strong><span>Try AUTO-PLAN, readiness, execution, quality and report flows.</span></div></div></div><div style="height:14px"></div>${tasks.map(([t,steps])=>`<details class="help-task"><summary>${esc(t)}</summary><div class="help-body"><ol>${steps.map(s=>`<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ol></div></details>`).join('')}`
}
